1
00:00:00,756 --> 00:00:02,336
(Amy:)Sheldon, what are you doing here?

2
00:00:02,508 --> 00:00:05,468
(Sheldon:)You didn't respond
to any of my electronic communications.

3
00:00:06,011 --> 00:00:07,051
(Amy:)I wanted to be alone.

4
00:00:10,015 --> 00:00:12,015
(Sheldon:)Would you like to talk about it?

5
00:00:12,184 --> 00:00:17,024
And keep in mind that "no"
is a perfectly viable answer.

6
00:00:18,023 --> 00:00:20,313
(Leonard:)Sheldon,
my world is crumbling around me.

7
00:00:20,484 --> 00:00:22,364
(Sheldon:)Point of order.

8
00:00:22,528 --> 00:00:24,198
(Sheldon:)As you're in distress...

9
00:00:24,363 --> 00:00:27,573
(Sheldon:)...it would be customary
for me to offer you a hot beverage.

10
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,660
(Sheldon:)But I'm a guest in your home...

11
00:00:30,828 --> 00:00:34,168
(Sheldon:)...so it would be customary
for you to offer me a beverage.

12
00:00:36,292 --> 00:00:39,252
How do you wanna proceed
vis-á- vis beverages?

13
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:42,590
(Amy:)It doesn't matter. Nothing matters.

14
00:00:44,008 --> 00:00:48,218
(Sheldon:)If you'd like to take your mind off
what's troubling you...

15
00:00:48,387 --> 00:00:52,307
(Sheldon:)...uh, word on the street is
a bobcat has been spotted.

16
00:00:53,517 --> 00:00:58,027
(Amy:)Penny and Bernadette went shopping
for bridesmaids dresses without me.

